decisions/lang.md:2848:## LANG-67 Open protocols as typed families of continuations: holes with polarity, linear tokens, obligations, the executed prefix, and the two-cell one-use-capability negotiation; nano's `interp_runs` re-derived as an instance (2026-10-22; ACTIVITIES-1; `redregg/work/ACTIVITIES-DESIGN-20261022.md` §9.4)
